    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/8735c7a5e87b6f9021a8b42bb0e48be8.poster.avif?t=1745937516\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/8735c7a5e87b6f9021a8b42bb0e48be8.webm?t=1745937516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Best friends Sok &amp; Jester devise a mischievous scheme to steal the Royal Diamond!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To complete their master plan, they must start an improv theatre show and outperform every other act - including their rivals, Hofnar &amp; Bok. Only becoming the best show in the kingdom will get them invited to the Royal Theatrical Spectacle in the Royal Palace, where the king keeps his precious gem. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They embark on a grand adventure across a fantasy kingdom, meeting tons of wacky characters, performing improvised shows and singing their hearts out. Along the way, they unintentionally discover the freedom and joy of musical theatre. Will the pair change their wicked ways or do whatever it takes to get rich? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/d1e92c0eb8574925049996c9946adf22.poster.avif?t=1745937516\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/d1e92c0eb8574925049996c9946adf22.webm?t=1745937516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EMBRACE YOUR CREATIVE FREEDOM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two shows are alike! The choices are yours as you decide how to wow your audience! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/cdd1c7ce94bec47c23385f54376deb60.poster.avif?t=1745937516\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/cdd1c7ce94bec47c23385f54376deb60.webm?t=1745937516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/cdd1c7ce94bec47c23385f54376deb60.mp4?t=1745937516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BEFRIEND WACKY CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet and befriend tons of quirky characters - all fully voiced! A friendly Wendigo, a tree looking for its roots and a blob of pesto to name a few. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/ce7429e473c05d4608f63f116f0a058a.poster.avif?t=1745937516\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/ce7429e473c05d4608f63f116f0a058a.webm?t=1745937516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/ce7429e473c05d4608f63f116f0a058a.mp4?t=1745937516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DIVE INTO A VIBRANT FANTASY KINGDOM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s always adventure time in hand-crafted locations like the cosy Dorp Town, the dark mysterious Woudwoods, and the radio-obsessed Stad City. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/554eb1a883b078ca5e4f70076693ec7b.poster.avif?t=1745937516\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/554eb1a883b078ca5e4f70076693ec7b.webm?t=1745937516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/554eb1a883b078ca5e4f70076693ec7b.mp4?t=1745937516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">VIBE TO THE INDIE TUNES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An original soundtrack, written and performed by the creators of the game, is here to burrow in your ear and never leave!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/76266ec9ceb80e688f0e5bbef221558f.poster.avif?t=1745937516\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/76266ec9ceb80e688f0e5bbef221558f.webm?t=1745937516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/76266ec9ceb80e688f0e5bbef221558f.mp4?t=1745937516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/8735c7a5e87b6f9021a8b42bb0e48be8.poster.avif?t=1745937516\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/8735c7a5e87b6f9021a8b42bb0e48be8.webm?t=1745937516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Best friends Sok &amp; Jester devise a mischievous scheme to steal the Royal Diamond!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To complete their master plan, they must start an improv theatre show and outperform every other act - including their rivals, Hofnar &amp; Bok. Only becoming the best show in the kingdom will get them invited to the Royal Theatrical Spectacle in the Royal Palace, where the king keeps his precious gem. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They embark on a grand adventure across a fantasy kingdom, meeting tons of wacky characters, performing improvised shows and singing their hearts out. Along the way, they unintentionally discover the freedom and joy of musical theatre. Will the pair change their wicked ways or do whatever it takes to get rich? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/d1e92c0eb8574925049996c9946adf22.poster.avif?t=1745937516\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/d1e92c0eb8574925049996c9946adf22.webm?t=1745937516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EMBRACE YOUR CREATIVE FREEDOM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two shows are alike! The choices are yours as you decide how to wow your audience! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/cdd1c7ce94bec47c23385f54376deb60.poster.avif?t=1745937516\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/cdd1c7ce94bec47c23385f54376deb60.webm?t=1745937516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/cdd1c7ce94bec47c23385f54376deb60.mp4?t=1745937516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BEFRIEND WACKY CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet and befriend tons of quirky characters - all fully voiced! A friendly Wendigo, a tree looking for its roots and a blob of pesto to name a few. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/ce7429e473c05d4608f63f116f0a058a.poster.avif?t=1745937516\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/ce7429e473c05d4608f63f116f0a058a.webm?t=1745937516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/ce7429e473c05d4608f63f116f0a058a.mp4?t=1745937516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DIVE INTO A VIBRANT FANTASY KINGDOM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s always adventure time in hand-crafted locations like the cosy Dorp Town, the dark mysterious Woudwoods, and the radio-obsessed Stad City. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/554eb1a883b078ca5e4f70076693ec7b.poster.avif?t=1745937516\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/554eb1a883b078ca5e4f70076693ec7b.webm?t=1745937516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/554eb1a883b078ca5e4f70076693ec7b.mp4?t=1745937516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">VIBE TO THE INDIE TUNES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An original soundtrack, written and performed by the creators of the game, is here to burrow in your ear and never leave!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/76266ec9ceb80e688f0e5bbef221558f.poster.avif?t=1745937516\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/76266ec9ceb80e688f0e5bbef221558f.webm?t=1745937516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668190/extras/76266ec9ceb80e688f0e5bbef221558f.mp4?t=1745937516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Travel the kingdom as Jester with his best friend Sok to improvise theatre shows and perform on stages far and wide. Sing your hearts out, crack jokes and impress audiences to become the stars of the famous Royal Theatrical Spectacle!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201c[...]really funny, and the art style is instantly appealing.\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br><br>\u201cThis hilarious and thoughtfully designed musical journey is a cosy campfire tonic and an important example of the sheer range of modern video games, in terms of subject matter, tone, and gameplay.\u201d<br>Metro GameCentral<br><br>\u201cBonte Avond has given us a unique, enjoyable, and memorable adventure that I couldn\u2019t recommend enough.\u201d<br>Impulse Gamer<br>",
